    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS\u00ae 10+(64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-4460, 2.70GHz or AMD FX\u2122-6300 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 760 or AMD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Dreamcore requires a GPU with Ray-Tracing support, as it is essential for the game's lighting system. If your graphics card does not support Ray-Tracing, some areas may render incorrectly, appear completely black, or exhibit severe visual artifacts.  You may still attempt to play the game, but please be aware that the experience may be significantly impacted.</li></ul>",
